# Environment variables for the devcontainer of u-boot.
#
# Docker reads this file with `--env-file` when the container starts.
# One `NAME=VALUE` per line. Quotes are part of the value, and a leading
# `export` is not allowed.
#
# This file is yours: u-boot never changes it once it exists. Keep it out
# of version control (`u-boot init` adds it to `.gitignore`; add the line
# `.devcontainer/devcontainer.env` yourself if your `.gitignore` lacks it).
# A template with placeholders is in `devcontainer.env.example`.
